# Wazuh

> Wazuh is a free, open source security platform that unifies XDR and SIEM
> protection for endpoints and cloud workloads. It provides threat detection,
> incident response, file integrity monitoring, vulnerability detection,
> security configuration assessment, and regulatory compliance, using a single
> universal agent and a unified platform. A managed Wazuh Cloud (SaaS) offering
> is also available.

