## Capabilities & use cases
- [File Integrity Monitoring](https://wazuh.com/resources/use-cases/file-integrity-monitoring/): Detect changes to critical files and directories.
- [Vulnerability detection](https://wazuh.com/resources/use-cases/vulnerability-detection/): Identify known vulnerabilities on monitored endpoints.
- [Security Configuration Assessment](https://wazuh.com/resources/use-cases/security-configuration-assessment/): Audit systems against CIS benchmarks and security best practices.
- [Malware detection](https://wazuh.com/resources/use-cases/malware-detection/): Detect malware, rootkits, and anomalies.
- [Threat hunting](https://wazuh.com/resources/use-cases/threat-hunting/): Proactively search telemetry for threats.
- [Log data analysis](https://wazuh.com/resources/use-cases/log-data-analysis/): Collect, normalize, and analyze logs.
- [Incident response](https://wazuh.com/resources/use-cases/incident-response/): Automated active response and remediation.
- [Regulatory compliance](https://wazuh.com/resources/use-cases/regulatory-compliance/): PCI DSS, HIPAA, GDPR, NIST 800-53, TSC, and more.
- [Container & cloud workload security](https://wazuh.com/resources/use-cases/container-security/): Protect containers and cloud workloads (AWS, Azure, GCP).

